Z||000016||Tigger||10-26-2000||11:43 AM||||I remember a "real cute" girl in one of my HS classes.  Her parents got her an almost brand new Reatta for her 16th B-day.  Lucky gal...<P>Ever since then, I kinda see the Fiero as being a "his" car, and the Reatta as a "hers" car even though it really doesn't matter.  Overall, I kinda like the Reatta for it's styling.<P>------------------<BR>T-T-F-N, Tah Tah For Now!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tiggerblue.gif"> ||||reg||1
