Z||000021||stsmithgt||10-26-2000||03:31 PM||||My mom's a school teacher.  Her Ninja(ZX-6) had a Corbin seat with pink flames and a license frame that said,"Nana from hell". You'd never Know it by looking at her that she like things other than sewing.  She likes my GT, but I had to convince her it was safe.  She looks at it being safe because I don't have a motorcycles anymore.  I crashed pretty hard on one of my bikes a couple of times(winter driving) and it made here worry too much.  I didn't tell them about me missing a curve in my car in an almond orchard last month.  Just because I missed all the trees doesn't mean a mother would freak. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
